      "sequence_position": 2,
      "problem": "Let $B=\\{{b}_{1},{b}_{2}\\}$ be a basis of ${R}^{2}$ and let $T:{R}^{2}\\to {R}^{2}$ be a linear transformation. Find $[T(x)]_{B}$, given that\n$\\,$ $[T]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}8 & 1 \\\\ 11 & -4\\end{aligned}]\\,$ and $\\,[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].$",
